// Converted 1:1 from apps/server/src/providerStore.ts (CXU plugins @ f2cb649d).
// FIX (stores batch): full body retranslation. Stale skeleton claims
// corrected: @napi-rs/keyring DOES have a sa_std surface
// (crypto.sai sa_keyring_available/get/remove; the "codex-react-ui"
// collection maps to the keyring collection argument), the SQLite
// layer is the plugin_sqlite facade over the LocalDatabase
// connection handle (same seam as authStore/auditLogStore), the
// catalog functions are imported from the relayCatalog unit for
// real (that unit's five exports are still semantic stubs — the
// remaining catalog blocker lives there, registered in
// _defects/FIX_SERVER_STORES.md), and codexUiDataDir comes from
// sdk-backend/src/dataDir.sla.
// Landed-model notes:
// - ProviderStore.db is the wiring layer's plugin_sqlite
//   connection handle; ProviderStore_new with has_database=false
//   leaves db=0 and schema/migration/persistence fail closed.
// - TS throws land on the i32 status channel (0 ok, 1 thrown) with
//   the message in the module last-error doc, readable via
//   ProviderStore_takeLastError (additive accessor).
// - The skeleton's asRecord/stringValue/booleanValue/stringArray/
//   uniqueStrings/stringRecord module helpers are renamed with a
//   ps_ prefix: relayCatalog.sla defines the same unprefixed names
//   and the real @import makes them collide.
// - registry maps (memorySecrets/transientProviders/
//   transientOnlyProviderIds) are JSON docs held in the struct,
//   initialized by ProviderStore_new.

